        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur GEOPRO, Province French Crystal Knob with Round Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSo often crystal knobs seem dated, but the Provence Crystal Knob with Georgetown Rose has a current feel that makes it perfect for modern homes that need a little something extra. The clear crystal is highlighted by the cuts at the base, which grant this egg shaped knob a chicness that is perfect for adding some sparkle to any room. The 24% lead content provides the perfect clarity necessary to make such a pure shape dazzle. It has a 10 year finish warranty and a lifetime mechanical warranty as well. It will fit doors 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-georgetown-series\"><b>Georgetown Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur GEOPRO Georgetown Provence Crystal Egg Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The Georgetown Rose is made out of solid forged brass and the Provence Knob is 24% lead crystal.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Crystal Egg Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Georgetown Rosette Diameter: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Provence Knob Height: 2.70\"</li>\r\n<li>Provence Knob Width: 1.7\"</li>\r\n<li>Provence Knob Projection: 2.10\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-GEOPRO-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262307\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur GEOPRO Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Provence Crystal Knob with Georgetown Rose",
                "description": "Grandeur GEOPRO Provence Crystal Knob with Georgetown Rose - So often crystal knobs seem dated, but the Provence Crystal Knob with Georgetown Rose has a current feel that makes it perfect for modern homes that need a little something extra. It has a 10 year finish warranty and a lifetime mechanical warranty as well. It will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
